{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id85951810"}, "name":{"label":"TheFloweryBattlefield"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-12-19T12:48:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"911591163"}, "title":{"label":"Awesome."}, "content":{"label":"Hands down awesome. I haven't listened to it while studying, but while laying in bed trying to clear my mind and focus on nothingness which requires great focus, by the way. Within twenty minutes I was in a very profound trance and felt two separate lines of energy run from the bck of my head down my spine and they joined at the bottom. Very powerful. Also passed out for two hours after I finished listening. I never take naps. But I was in a very deep state of sleep. \nAbout to sit down to make some art and listen to it now, I will come back and let you know how that was!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
