{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id167916217"}, "name":{"label":"Wslich"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-12-01T16:27:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"903298564"}, "title":{"label":"Works great for me"}, "content":{"label":"Focus@Will has performed very well for me.  It has definitely increased my productivity on a variety of tasks. \n\nI see that other viewers have had technical issues with crashes, etc.  I initially encountered some problems but they have been resolved with minimal effort.  \n\nUsing the website, the service works better for me when run in the Chrome OS rather than Explorer.  Using Chrome it has been very reliable.\n\nI initially had problems getting the app to work on my mobile devices.  The tech support at Focus@Will responded quickly to my e-mail request.  They gave me clear instructions on how to resolve the problems. Since then it has worked well for me on iPad and iPhone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
