{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24157581"}, "name":{"label":"Smslc2011"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-09-16T17:08:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"871370555"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app!  Premium account well worth it"}, "content":{"label":"I tried this app, and right away saw the value.\n\nDon't be afraid to try different musical styles...including intensity level.  \n\nThe premium account that unlocks full functionality is ABSOLUTELY worth a cup of coffee a month.\n\nWith different musical styles and intensities, I really like how I can dial up the right option depending on my mood and what I'm working on.  \n\nI use this every single day.  Awesome!\n\nOnly thing that would be great to add is offline mode...and according to the developer that's on their list and should be coming.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
