{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id350449642"}, "name":{"label":"Turtlebiter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2013-09-11T07:43:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.0"}, "id":{"label":"868689774"}, "title":{"label":"I don't know if it works"}, "content":{"label":"When I started using this I found the ambient at low intensity to be relaxing \nand it seeming to help me focus a little. On the third or fourth use it wanted me to create an account. Now it will only play spa on medium in intensity which isn't is distracting and gets under my skin. The music is always stuttering and  stopping and it takes two or three crashes before it begins in the first place.\n\nWhile it did seem to help a little, it's not magic. Ambient music on any of the other streaming radios work just as well for me. I'm glad I found this app because it gave me the idea, but I'll stick with my usual radio apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
